      "id": "claim_818ff709203e455fa4299f4cd0cef940",
      "statement": "can_read(user, document) is the single access predicate implemented once as a domain method (Document.can_be_read_by) and as a SQL predicate, reused by the API, MCP server, and citation resolution. Releases 1–3: owner_id == sub; Release 4 extends to document_grants rows and visibility=public.",
