    {
      "id": "claim_f0246204f2824a50bcc5ea42739ded97",
      "statement": "The MCP server builds its SQL search filter as: content_id IN (documents WHERE owner_id=sub AND state='ready' AND archived=FALSE AND subject_id = ANY(subject_ids)). An empty readable set returns an empty result and the agent surfaces the US-10 message, not an error.",
