    {
      "id": "claim_66c86f6db2624fa09772a872fbc5428d",
      "statement": "The S3 key structure uploads/<user_id>/<upload_id>.pdf binds every presigned POST upload to its owner. A browser-supplied hash may skip a redundant upload only for a file already in the learner's own library; the server always independently computes SHA-256 from uploaded bytes before deduplication linking, preventing hash-based access to another learner's file.",
