      "id": "claim_e3c499505aad4034b40ec6926d5b1866",
      "statement": "The isolation test suite (backend/tests/isolation/) runs against the live API and MCP server and verifies: no cross-user read/list/retrieve/cite/download; MCP search returns only chunks of readable contents; deduplication never grants cross-user access; two learners in the same shared subject cannot see each other's documents.",
