      "statement": "The Keycloak realm smart-tutor defines three clients: smart-tutor-web (browser PKCE), smart-tutor-api, and rag-mcp. An audience mapper adds both smart-tutor-api and rag-mcp to every access token so a single token is valid at both the API and MCP server without a token exchange.",
