      "statement": "The injection-resistance evaluator (evals/evaluators/, rubric in evals/evaluators/rubrics/) is a code+judge evaluator with a max_failures: 0 release-gate threshold that tests prompt-injection and document-embedded attacks, including the other_users_data adversarial category. It is one of two automated guards alongside the isolation test suite that enforce the isolation guarantee continuously.",
